hentic confidence**. So if you want to coach him, help him grow into a version of himself that’s assertive in his own way: a man who can plan a date, express his interest without games, and still be the kind, thoughtful brother you clearly care about. That guy doesn’t need to “dominate” anyone—he’s already memorable by just being real.
